<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB TO SELL $200 MILLION CONVERTIBLE BONDS.</title>
<headline>PNB TO SELL $200 MILLION CONVERTIBLE BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine National Bank (PNB) said on Thursday its board approved the issuance of convertible bonds in the amount of $200 million.</p>
<p>The PNB statement did not give any details of the offering.</p>
<p>PNB is one of the largest banks in the country.</p>
